#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j3-made-official.json:19
msgctxt "step.headline"
msgid "Nurse Chanthasone scans the card, and her tablet checks Taifafeki’s digital signature against the WHO trust list — without contacting Taifafeki."
msgstr "Chanthasone 护士扫描卡片，她的平板电脑对照 WHO 信任列表核查泰法费基的数字签名——无需联系泰法费基。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j3-made-official.json:188
msgctxt "step.headline"
msgid "The Taifafeki Hep B product doesn’t match anything on the Onesan schedule. Chanthasone makes the clinical call, and the system works out what’s due next."
msgstr "泰法费基的 Hep B 产品与奥内萨接种计划中的任何条目都不匹配。Chanthasone 作出临床判断，系统计算出下一步到期的剂次。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j3-made-official.json:131
#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j3-made-official.json:131
msgctxt "step.illustration.alt"
msgid "At the district health centre, Nurse Chanthasone checks the cards on a tablet: signature verified, on the Onesan schedule; Khamla and Bounmy hold Somsack"
msgstr "在区卫生中心，Chanthasone 护士在平板电脑上核查卡片：签名已验证，已纳入奥内萨接种计划；Khamla 和 Bounmy 抱着 Somsack"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j3-made-official.json:35
msgctxt "step.narrative"
msgid ""
"Nurse Chanthasone opens the referral and scans the QRs. The EHR\n"
"**verifies** each DVC offline against that copy (STT-VER-001…009,\n"
"STT-KID-002), without contacting Taifafeki. Both verify, so it imports them as\n"
"FHIR `Immunization`s (`TrustDemoJ3HepB`, `TrustDemoJ3Bcg`) with provenance\n"
"(`TrustDemoJ3Verification`; STT-VER-007, STT-VER-008), replacing the reported\n"
"doses of J2. If a DVC fails (a tampered card, say), the EHR names the step and\n"
"the reason, the doses stay unverified, and the nurse decides by national\n"
"catch-up policy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Chanthasone 护士打开转诊单并扫描 QR 码。EHR 针对该副本离线**验证**每个 DVC（STT-VER-001…009、STT-KID-002），无需联系泰法费基。两者都验证通过，因此它将其作为 FHIR `Immunization`（`TrustDemoJ3HepB`、`TrustDemoJ3Bcg`）连同来源记录（`TrustDemoJ3Verification`；STT-VER-007、STT-VER-008）一并导入，取代 J2 中已报告的剂次。如果某个 DVC 验证失败（例如卡片被篡改），EHR 会指明失败的步骤和原因，剂次保持未验证，由护士依据国家补种政策作出决定。\n"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j3-made-official.json:192
msgctxt "step.narrative"
msgid ""
"The Taifafeki Hep B product matches nothing on the national schedule.\n"
"The EHR keeps Taifafeki's product coding and adds the schedule coding beside\n"
"it, from the national map (`TrustDemoProductToOnesaEpi`). For the Hep B product\n"
"the map has no entry, so Nurse Chanthasone makes the clinical call that it is\n"
"the schedule's birth dose (`TrustDemoJ3Adjudication`), and her decision is\n"
"added to the map for the next clinic. The schedule (`TrustDemoOnesaInfantSchedule`)\n"
"then runs: the birth doses count, and pentavalent 1, bOPV 1 and PCV 1 are due\n"
"at 6 weeks (`TrustDemoJ3Recommendation`). Khamla leaves with the date\n"
"(`TrustDemoJ3Reminder`). Over the year Somsack gets those doses and\n"
"measles-rubella at 9 months, in Onesa.\n"
msgstr ""
"泰法费基的 Hep B 产品与国家接种计划中的任何条目都不匹配。EHR 保留泰法费基的产品编码，并根据国家映射表（`TrustDemoProductToOnesaEpi`）在其旁边添加接种计划编码。对于该 Hep B 产品，映射表中没有条目，因此 Chanthasone 护士作出临床判断，认定它是接种计划中的出生剂次（`TrustDemoJ3Adjudication`），她的决定被加入映射表，供下一家诊所使用。随后接种计划（`TrustDemoOnesaInfantSchedule`）开始运行：出生剂次计入，五联疫苗第 1 剂、bOPV 第 1 剂和 PCV 第 1 剂在 6 周龄时到期（`TrustDemoJ3Recommendation`）。Khamla 带着日期离开（`TrustDemoJ3Reminder`）。在这一年里，Somsack 在奥内萨接种了这些剂次，并在 9 月龄时接种麻疹-风疹疫苗。\n"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j3-made-official.json:51
msgctxt "step.painPoint"
msgid "Clinicians either distrust foreign paper and re-vaccinate, or trust it blindly."
msgstr "临床医生要么不信任外国纸质记录而重新接种，要么盲目信任。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j3-made-official.json:208
msgctxt "step.painPoint"
msgid "Countries name and package vaccines differently, so doses get missed or repeated."
msgstr "各国对疫苗的命名和包装各不相同，因此剂次会被遗漏或重复。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j3-made-official.json:210
msgctxt "step.policy"
msgid "Never overwrite another country’s record: keep the original coding alongside the national one."
msgstr "绝不覆盖另一个国家的记录：在国家编码旁边保留原始编码。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j3-made-official.json:53
msgctxt "step.policy"
msgid "Trust is decentralized: an Onesan clinic verifies a Taifafeki signature itself, without contacting Taifafeki."
msgstr "信任是去中心化的：奥内萨诊所自行验证泰法费基签名，无需联系泰法费基。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j3-made-official.json:26
msgctxt "step.preconditions.description"
msgid "**Precondition: the DID documents are already loaded.** Loading them is not a step of this visit. The clinic may be offline all day, so the EHR fetches nothing during it: its trust store holds the GDHCN DEV trust list as it was last refreshed, including XXR's DSC DID document (STT-TRU-001, STT-TRU-002, STT-TRU-005). A clinic with no connection of its own refreshes it about weekly, when the CHW visits the base clinic or district health office, where Country B retrieves the list the GDHCN trust anchor distributes. A DSC published after that refresh is not in the clinic's copy, so its DVC fails the trust-list check (STT-VER-006) until the next refresh."
msgstr "**前提条件：DID 文档已加载。**加载它们不是此次就诊的步骤。诊所可能整天离线，因此 EHR 在就诊期间不获取任何内容：其信任存储中保存着上次刷新时的 GDHCN DEV 信任列表，包括 XXR 的 DSC DID 文档（STT-TRU-001、STT-TRU-002、STT-TRU-005）。没有自身网络连接的诊所大约每周刷新一次，即 CHW 前往基地诊所或区卫生办公室时，B 国在那里获取 GDHCN 信任锚所分发的列表。在该次刷新之后发布的 DSC 不在诊所的副本中，因此其 DVC 在下次刷新前都无法通过信任列表检查（STT-VER-006）。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j3-made-official.json:25
msgctxt "step.preconditions.title"
msgid "The DID documents are already loaded"
msgstr "DID 文档已加载"

